-A parallel volume rendering strategy for Adaptive Mesh Refinement (AMR) meshes where MultiFABs are processed independently by a GPU renderer and results are combined via MPI reduction [S1, unofficial]. It differs from standard brick renderers by explicitly handling the topological dependencies and non-convexities inherent in AMR grids through a "convexification" preprocessing step, ensuring correct alpha blending for color and emissivity cases [S1, unofficial].
